From 2ade1c786f17d3343dcf964ed937b0e37b0a8df6 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Hades <15710513+hadesdevls@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 12 Nov 2026 03:35:26 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 2/2] updates: the Spanish help of Automatic Updates fits its
 box

The help box under the list of a section shows three lines. In Spanish
(es_es, es_mx and es_ar), the help of "Automatic Updates" in a system
without an update channel took four, and its last words were cut off.
The same text, with the address of the published versions at its end
and two words fewer ("no se busca ni se descarga" is now "no busca ni
descarga"), takes three. es_ar keeps the English name "Available
Versions", the one that its list shows. The English text, which takes
three lines, is not changed.

Seen on the screen of a virtual machine in es_es, es_mx and es_ar.
Tested with the test of Updates: 13 checks of the help in English
and Spanish (each Spanish text names "Available Versions" as its
language shows it and ends with the address); they fail on the texts
before this change and on each of 3 changes that undo a part of
it.
---
 resources/language/resource.language.es_ar/strings.po | 2 +-
 resources/language/resource.language.es_es/strings.po | 2 +-
 resources/language/resource.language.es_mx/strings.po | 2 +-
 3 files changed, 3 insertions(+), 3 deletions(-)

diff --git a/resources/language/resource.language.es_ar/strings.po b/resources/language/resource.language.es_ar/strings.po
index 0638ef5..3e4974e 100644
--- a/resources/language/resource.language.es_ar/strings.po
+++ b/resources/language/resource.language.es_ar/strings.po
@@ -1300,7 +1300,7 @@ msgstr "Este sistema tiene su almacenamiento en memoria, como en el modo live: e
 
 msgctxt "#32970"
 msgid "LibreELEC Hades has no update channel yet, so nothing is looked for or downloaded by itself, whatever is chosen here. Its new versions are published at https://github.com/hadesdevls/LibreELEC-Hades/releases, and \"Available Versions\" says how to install one."
-msgstr "LibreELEC Hades todavía no tiene un canal de actualizaciones: no se busca ni se descarga nada por sí solo, se elija lo que se elija acá. Sus versiones nuevas se publican en https://github.com/hadesdevls/LibreELEC-Hades/releases, y \"Available Versions\" explica cómo instalar una."
+msgstr "LibreELEC Hades todavía no tiene un canal de actualizaciones: no busca ni descarga nada por sí solo, se elija lo que se elija acá. \"Available Versions\" explica cómo instalar las versiones nuevas, que se publican en https://github.com/hadesdevls/LibreELEC-Hades/releases."
 
 msgctxt "#32971"
 msgid "Hardware clock"
